<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Tic Tac Toe WebRTC Signaling Server</title>
    <style>
        body {
            background-color: #0d0e15;
            color: #ffffff;
            font-family: 'Outfit', sans-serif;
            display: flex;
            justify-content: center;
            align-items: center;
            height: 100vh;
            margin: 0;
            text-align: center;
        }
        .container {
            background-color: #1a1c29;
            padding: 40px;
            border-radius: 20px;
            border: 2px solid #2a2d43;
            box-shadow: 0 0 20px rgba(0,240,255,0.2);
        }
        h1 {
            color: #00f0ff;
            margin-bottom: 10px;
        }
        p {
            color: #888c9e;
            font-size: 1.2rem;
        }
        .status {
            margin-top: 30px;
            font-size: 1.5rem;
            font-weight: bold;
            color: #ff0055;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="container">
        <h1>Signaling Server Active</h1>
        <p>This server handles WebRTC connections for the Tic Tac Toe multiplayer.</p>
        <div class="status">Active Rooms: <%= activeRooms %></div>
    </div>
</body>
</html>
